{c: Verse 1}
[F#] [Bm],        Aur is dil me...kya rakha hai
[F#] [Bm] [F#],        Tera hee dard ....chhupa rakha hai
[F#] [Bm],        Chir ke dekhe .....dil mera toh
[F#] [Bm] [F#],        Tera hi nam .....likha rakha hai
[F#],        Pyar ke afasane sune the logo se
[E] [F#],        Pyar kya hota hai, yeh tune samajaya
[F#],        Mila dil tuj se toh, khwab dekhe aise
[E] [F#],        Junun jane kaisa, jawan dil pe chhaya
[F#],        Dil me ayesa dard uthha,
[Bm],        dil ho gaya diwana
[F#],        Dil ho gaya diwana
[F#] [Bm],        Diwano ne iss duniya me
[F#] [Bm] [F#],        Dard kaa nam dawan rakha hai
[F#],        Nigaho me meree yeh surat hain teree
[E] [F#],        Jindagee yeh meree amanat hain teree
[F#],        Dhadkate sine me mohabbat hain teree
[E] [F#],        Mohabbat yeh teree, ibadat hain meree
[F#],        Tere siwa kuchh yad nahee hai
[Bm],        Too hi too dil me
